{"3987420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buenos Aires Mirror Line", "steam_appid": 3987420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> I am not proud of what I have become</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes I feel that my efforts will be in vain, that the harm I cause is not worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I cannot give up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that I am trapped here, maybe, just maybe, I can understand what to do to stop suffering.<br><br>Something or someone  has trapped you in this loop.<br>Who knows what might happen if you don’t return to your reality soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A horror game set in the heart of Buenos Aires, Argentina.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f4960aea406db6d776678ba8ddd898bc.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f4960aea406db6d776678ba8ddd898bc.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that expose a disturbing history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/52877bae211560b572336b41f943d13d.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/52877bae211560b572336b41f943d13d.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot what doesn’t belong during a bus ride to an obscure destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f7bdcbf67463ce619d8addc163fe9137.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f7bdcbf67463ce619d8addc163fe9137.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you board the right bus thirteen times in a row, you’ll get out… or at least that’s what they told you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the deities, and maybe you’ll get something in return.<br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Experimental music based on Argentinian cumbia and reggaeton,</strong><br><br><strong>Buenos Aires Mirror Line</strong> is a <strong>short and intense psychological horror game</strong>. Inspired by surreal titles such as <i>Who's At the Door</i> and <i>Exit 8</i>, it offers <strong>between 40 and 90 minutes of immersive gameplay</strong>, allowing players to <strong>unravel a disturbing story of introspection.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>WARNING:</strong><br><strong></strong><br><u><i>This game touches sensitive subjects such as suicide and illness</i></u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> I am not proud of what I have become</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes I feel that my efforts will be in vain, that the harm I cause is not worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I cannot give up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that I am trapped here, maybe, just maybe, I can understand what to do to stop suffering.<br><br>Something or someone  has trapped you in this loop.<br>Who knows what might happen if you don’t return to your reality soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A horror game set in the heart of Buenos Aires, Argentina.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f4960aea406db6d776678ba8ddd898bc.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f4960aea406db6d776678ba8ddd898bc.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that expose a disturbing history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/52877bae211560b572336b41f943d13d.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/52877bae211560b572336b41f943d13d.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot what doesn’t belong during a bus ride to an obscure destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f7bdcbf67463ce619d8addc163fe9137.poster.avif?t=1782744090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/extras/f7bdcbf67463ce619d8addc163fe9137.webm?t=1782744090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you board the right bus thirteen times in a row, you’ll get out… or at least that’s what they told you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the deities, and maybe you’ll get something in return.<br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Experimental music based on Argentinian cumbia and reggaeton,</strong><br><br><strong>Buenos Aires Mirror Line</strong> is a <strong>short and intense psychological horror game</strong>. Inspired by surreal titles such as <i>Who's At the Door</i> and <i>Exit 8</i>, it offers <strong>between 40 and 90 minutes of immersive gameplay</strong>, allowing players to <strong>unravel a disturbing story of introspection.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>WARNING:</strong><br><strong></strong><br><u><i>This game touches sensitive subjects such as suicide and illness</i></u></p>", "short_description": "Carefully observe your sorroundings and come back to your reality by finding what doesn't fit. If something's wrong take the bus back from across the street. A game situated in the haze of Buenos Aires.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/3f8ea0186e80eea75a82ddece85bd932f40142d0/header.jpg?t=1782744090", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/7e7d24414b54299899470b35634bd94b6de101ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782744090", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987420/7e7d24414b54299899470b35634bd94b6de101ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782744090", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> A modern one<br></li><li><strong>Memory